{"task_id": "Mbpp/3", "solution": "import math\n\ndef is_not_prime(number: int) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"\n    Identifies non-prime numbers. Returns True for non-prime, False for prime.\n    \"\"\"\n    if number <= 1:\n        return True\n    if number == 2:\n        return False\n    if number % 2 == 0:\n        return True\n    \n    # Check for divisors from 3 up to sqrt(number), only odd numbers\n    for i in range(3, int(math.sqrt(number)) + 1, 2):\n        if number % i == 0:\n            return True\n            \n    return False"}
