{"task_id": "Mbpp/68", "solution": "def is_Monotonic(array) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"\n    Check if the given array is monotonic.\n    An array is monotonic if it is either non-decreasing or non-increasing.\n    \"\"\"\n    if len(array) <= 1:\n        return True\n\n    is_increasing = True\n    is_decreasing = True\n\n    for i in range(1, len(array)):\n        if array[i] > array[i-1]:\n            is_decreasing = False\n        elif array[i] < array[i-1]:\n            is_increasing = False\n        \n        # If it's neither increasing nor decreasing (i.e., trend changed back and forth)\n        if not is_increasing and not is_decreasing:\n            return False\n\n    return is_increasing or is_decreasing"}
