{"task_id": "Mbpp/222", "solution": "def check_type(input_tuple: tuple) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"\n    Checks if all elements in the input tuple have the same data type.\n    Returns True for empty or single-element tuples.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not input_tuple:\n        return True\n    \n    first_type = type(input_tuple[0])\n    for element in input_tuple:\n        if type(element) is not first_type:\n            return False\n    return True"}
