{"task_id": "Mbpp/224", "solution": "def count_Set_Bits(number: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Counts the number of set bits (binary digits with value 1) in a given number.\n    This implementation uses Brian Kernighan's algorithm for efficiency.\n    \"\"\"\n    count = 0\n    while number > 0:\n        number &= (number - 1)  # Clears the least significant set bit\n        count += 1\n    return count"}
