{"task_id": "Mbpp/264", "solution": "def dog_age(human_age: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates a dog's age in dog years using a specific conversion formula.\n    The formula is designed to produce 61 dog years for 12 human years.\n    \"\"\"\n    if human_age == 1:\n        return 10\n    elif human_age == 2:\n        return 21\n    else: # human_age > 2\n        # For ages beyond two human years, each additional human year\n        # adds 4 dog years, building on the 21 dog years for the first two.\n        return 21 + (human_age - 2) * 4"}
