{"task_id": "Mbpp/428", "solution": "def shell_sort(array: list) -> list:\n    \"\"\"Sorts an array in ascending order using the Shell Sort algorithm.\"\"\"\n    n = len(array)\n    # Generate initial gap using Knuth's sequence (3k + 1)\n    gap = 1\n    while gap < n // 3:\n        gap = gap * 3 + 1\n\n    while gap >= 1:\n        # Perform insertion sort for elements at current gap\n        for i in range(gap, n):\n            temp = array[i]\n            j = i\n            while j >= gap and array[j - gap] > temp:\n                array[j] = array[j - gap]\n                j -= gap\n            array[j] = temp\n        # Decrease the gap\n        gap //= 3\n    return array"}
