{"task_id": "Mbpp/445", "solution": "def index_multiplication(tuple1, tuple2):\n    \"\"\"\n    Performs index-wise multiplication of tuple elements, supporting nested tuples.\n    \"\"\"\n    _validate_inputs(tuple1, tuple2)\n\n    results = []\n    for e1, e2 in zip(tuple1, tuple2):\n        results.append(_multiply_elements(e1, e2))\n    return tuple(results)\n\ndef _multiply_elements(elem1, elem2):\n    \"\"\"\n    Helper function to multiply individual elements or recursively\n    multiply nested tuples.\n    \"\"\"\n    if isinstance(elem1, tuple) and isinstance(elem2, tuple):\n        return index_multiplication(elem1, elem2)\n    else:\n        return elem1 * elem2\n\ndef _validate_inputs(tuple1, tuple2):\n    \"\"\"\n    Helper function to validate if input tuples have equal length.\n    \"\"\"\n    return len(tuple1) == len(tuple2)"}
