{"task_id": "Mbpp/457", "solution": "from typing import List\n\ndef Find_Min(input_list: List[List]) -> List:\n    \"\"\"\n    Find the sublist with minimum length from a list of sublists.\n\n    Args:\n        input_list: List of sublists to process\n\n    Returns:\n        The sublist with minimum length (first occurrence if multiple exist), or None if input_list is empty.\n    \"\"\"\n    min_length = float('inf')\n    result_sublist = None\n\n    for sublist in input_list:\n        current_length = len(sublist)\n        if current_length < min_length:\n            min_length = current_length\n            result_sublist = sublist\n\n    return result_sublist"}
