{"task_id": "Mbpp/478", "solution": "def remove_lowercase(input_string: str) -> str:\n    \"\"\"\n    Removes all consecutive lowercase character sequences from the input string.\n    Uppercase characters are preserved.\n    \"\"\"\n    result_chars = []\n    i = 0\n    while i < len(input_string):\n        char = input_string[i]\n        if char.isupper():\n            result_chars.append(char)\n            i += 1\n        else:\n            # If the character is lowercase, skip this entire lowercase substring\n            while i < len(input_string) and input_string[i].islower():\n                i += 1\n    return \"\".join(result_chars)"}
