{"task_id": "Mbpp/592", "solution": "import math\n\ndef sum_Of_product(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of products of consecutive binomial coefficients C(n,k) * C(n,k+1).\n    \"\"\"\n\n    def calculate_binomial_coefficient(n_val: int, k_val: int) -> int:\n        \"\"\"\n        Calculates the binomial coefficient C(n_val, k_val) using factorials.\n        \"\"\"\n        if k_val < 0 or k_val > n_val:\n            return 0\n        return math.factorial(n_val) // (math.factorial(k_val) * math.factorial(n_val - k_val))\n\n    total_sum = 0\n    # Iterate k from 0 to n-1 to calculate products C(n,k) * C(n,k+1)\n    for k in range(n):\n        product = calculate_binomial_coefficient(n, k) * \\\n                  calculate_binomial_coefficient(n, k + 1)\n        total_sum += product\n    \n    return total_sum"}
