{"task_id": "Mbpp/611", "solution": "def max_of_nth(matrix, n):\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the maximum value in the n-th column of a matrix.\n    Assumes matrix is non-empty and n is a valid column index.\n    \"\"\"\n    max_val = matrix[0][n]\n    for row in matrix[1:]:\n        if row[n] > max_val:\n            max_val = row[n]\n    return max_val"}
