{"task_id": "Mbpp/633", "solution": "def pair_xor_Sum(numbers: list, count: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of XORs of all unique pairs of numbers in the given list.\n    It iterates through all possible unique pairs and accumulates their XOR results.\n    \"\"\"\n    total_xor_sum = 0\n\n    # Iterate through each number using its index\n    for i in range(count):\n        # Iterate through the remaining numbers to form unique pairs (j > i)\n        for j in range(i + 1, count):\n            # Calculate the XOR of the current pair and add it to the running total\n            total_xor_sum += (numbers[i] ^ numbers[j])\n\n    return total_xor_sum"}
