{"task_id": "Mbpp/644", "solution": "from typing import List\n\ndef reverse_Array_Upto_K(array: List, position: int) -> List:\n    \"\"\"\n    Reverses elements of array from index 0 up to position (exclusive).\n    Returns a new list with first 'position' elements reversed and remaining elements unchanged.\n    \"\"\"\n    # Slice the array into two parts: the part to be reversed and the remaining part\n    part_to_reverse = array[:position]\n    remaining_part = array[position:]\n\n    # Reverse the first part\n    reversed_part = part_to_reverse[::-1]\n\n    # Concatenate the reversed part with the remaining part\n    return reversed_part + remaining_part"}
