{"task_id": "Mbpp/786", "solution": "from typing import List\n\ndef right_insertion(array: List[int], target: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Locates the right insertion point for a specified value in a sorted array.\n    This function finds the index where `target` can be inserted to maintain\n    sorted order, ensuring it is placed after any existing equal elements.\n    \"\"\"\n    low = 0\n    high = len(array)\n\n    while low < high:\n        mid = low + (high - low) // 2\n        if array[mid] <= target:\n            low = mid + 1\n        else:\n            high = mid\n    return low"}
