{"task_id": "Mbpp/799", "solution": "def left_rotate(number, d):\n    \"\"\"\n    Rotates the bits of a 32-bit number to the left by d positions.\n    Bits shifted off the left end wrap around to the right end.\n    \"\"\"\n    BITS = 32\n    # Ensure d is within the range [0, BITS-1]\n    d = d % BITS\n    # Perform the left rotation\n    rotated = ((number << d) | (number >> (BITS - d)))\n    # Mask to keep the result within 32 bits\n    return rotated & ((1 << BITS) - 1)"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/801", "solution": "def test_three_equal(a: int, b: int, c: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Counts the number of equal values among three given integers.\n    Returns 3 if all three are equal, 2 if exactly two are equal, and 0 otherwise.\n    \"\"\"\n    if a == b and b == c:\n        return 3\n    elif a == b or a == c or b == c:\n        return 2\n    else:\n        return 0"}
